# Architecture

Decouple at real boundaries (domain modules, adapters for external services, platform bindings). No speculative abstractions or single-implementation interfaces.

Modules talk through explicit public entry points. No deep imports across modules.

The current directories, who they depend on, and the target boundaries are in `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`. Ponytail still applies: do not add a module, wrapper, or interface for a single caller.

Worker code stays on the Cloudflare skills named in `AGENTS.md`.
